 232  8125              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
 233  8125              ; Sweep the nine requested standard PC display resolutions.
 234  8125              ; Each mode uses 8-bpp indexed pixels and writes exactly its visible
 235  8125              ; framebuffer size. Use only the adapter's initialized EGA palette
 236  8125              ; entries 0..7, matching the proven Project132 test pattern.
 237  8125              ; SPACE advances to the next resolution.
 238  8125              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
